  "name": "Void Shift",
  "type": "spell",
  "img": "icons/svg/daze.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You redistribute up to 40 hit points between yourself and a willing creature within range. You may transfer any amount of hit points from yourself to the target, from the target to yourself, or any combination, as long as the total exchanged doesn't exceed 40 and neither creature would be reduced to 0 hit points.</p><p><strong><em>At Higher Levels.</em></strong> When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the maximum hit points you can exchange increases by 10 for each slot level above 3rd.</p>",
